Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FoggyRainyIntersection" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition .

:risk1 a :WeatherRisk ;
    :description "Severely reduced visibility due to fog and rain" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:risk2 a :RoadConditionRisk ;
    :description "Wet road surfaces creating potential for skidding" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.60"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Severely reduced visibility due to fog and rain
Severity Score: 0.75

Risk 2:
Description: Wet road surfaces creating potential for skidding
Severity Score: 0.60